    "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nUpdates the gem release workflow to a fixed twice-monthly cadence by introducing an automated “bump versions” PR flow and separating “sync pins/lockfiles” from “bump versions” behavior in the gem-version generator tooling.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Add `--auto-bump` mode to `gen_gem_versions.rb` and remove the prior `--check` flow.\n- Split `bin/chore` gem-version commands into `gen gem-versions` (sync only) vs `update gem-versions` (auto-bump + sync).\n- Add a scheduled GitHub Actions workflow to open PRs for gem version bumps; update `udb` release documentation to match the new automation.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 3 out of 4 changed files in this pull request and generated 5 comments.\n\n| File | Description |\n| ---- | ----------- |\n| tools/scripts/gen_gem_versions.rb | Adds `--auto-bump` gating for version bump steps while always syncing gemspec pins + lockfiles. |\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/RELEASE.md | Updates release docs to reference new workflows and the version-bump automation. |\n| bin/chore | Introduces `chore update gem-versions` and clarifies `gen gem-versions` is sync-only. |\n| .github/workflows/gem_bump.yml | Adds a scheduled workflow to create automated gem bump PRs on the 1st/15th. |\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/riscv/riscv-unified-db/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
